N: {VAR BE09 0001}It's over!{VAR BE01}
Never again will Pokémon be made to
suffer or be held captive by humans.{VAR BE01}
It's all thanks to my friend, Reshiram!{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

N: {VAR BE09 0001}It's over!{VAR BE01}
Never again will Pokémon be made to
suffer or be held captive by humans.{VAR BE01}
It's all thanks to my friend, Zekrom!{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}You may have the title of Champion...
But you can't stop me with just a title.{VAR BE00}
Your soft heart has left you weak.{VAR BE01}
Years ago, you lost your Pokémon,
your partner, to sickness.{VAR BE01}
In order to forget the pain in your
heart, you wandered Unova...{VAR BE01}
Who knows how long it's been since you've
had to fight with your full strength?{VAR BE01}
I actually kind of like that
about you, though.{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}As a Trainer who far outmatches
the Champion,{VAR BE00}
I shall issue an order across Unova:{VAR BE01}
Trainers of the world,
free your Pokémon!{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

Alder: I beg you!{VAR BE01}
Separating people from Pokémon...
Do anything but that!{VAR BE01}

N: {VAR BE09 0001}You and I both put our beliefs on the
line and fought with all our strength.{VAR BE01}
And I won.{VAR BE01}
Do not say another word.{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}In the future I envisioned, you obtained
a stone. And, indeed, you have.{VAR BE01}
That Dark Stone...
Reshiram is responding to it.{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}In the future I envisioned, you obtained
a stone. And, indeed, you have.{VAR BE01}
That Light Stone...
Zekrom is responding to it.{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}Stop.{VAR BE01}
This is not a suitable place
for the legendary dragons!{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}From the ground, rise up!
The castle of Team Plasma!{VAR BE00}
Surround the Pokémon League!{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

N: {VAR BE09 0001}What has just appeared is
Team Plasma's castle.{VAR BE01}
The king's words will resound
from the heights to all below.{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}You must come to the castle, as well.
Everything will be decided there.{VAR BE01}
Whether Pokémon will be liberated
from people,{VAR BE00}
or whether Pokémon and people{VAR BE00}
will live together...{VAR BE01}
We will see whose belief is stronger...
And our result will change the world.{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR 0100 0000}!
Tell N this...{VAR BE01}
Some people grow stronger by being
with Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
My Pokémon and I are proof. Together,
we learned and became stronger.{VAR BE01}

Alder: I... I lost.{VAR BE01}
I should have been able to demonstrate
the bond between me and my Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
That would have shown that brat the
worthlessness of his outrageous dreams.{VAR BE01}
So, his convictions were the real thing...
Be careful.{VAR BE01}
The ones who change the world are always
the ones who pursued their dreams.{VAR BE01}
{VAR 0100 0000}, I ask this of you.{VAR BE01}
Even if Pokémon and people are
separated, nothing good will come of it.{VAR BE00}
Please let him know that!{VAR BE01}

