Alder: I am grateful for
what you did about N.{VAR BE01}
I don't know what he's thinking now,
but I'm sure he realizes{VAR BE00}
that different people and Pokémon{VAR BE00}
have their own paths to follow.{VAR BE01}
Say now, how about a match with the
strongest Trainer in the Unova region?{VAR BE01}

